# Written by `next dev`, `next build` and `next typegen`, and different for
# each: dev points it at .next/dev/types, a build at .next/types. Tracked, it
# showed up modified after every dev run and rode along into commits.
# `npm run typecheck` runs `next typegen` first, so a fresh clone still has it.
